# The PS2's tfrag geomorph on the 3DS (Azahar): the title flight, then Fire Canyon and village2
# (shots on the way; the [ctr] tfrag geomorph and streaming lines in the log).
0 wait *target* target-title-wait
600 shot tfraglod_emu_title_600
1200 shot tfraglod_emu_title_1200
1500 continue firecanyon-start
1501 wait *target* target-continue
1502 wait *target* target-stance
1800 shot tfraglod_emu_firecanyon
2100 continue village2-start
2101 wait *target* target-continue
2102 wait *target* target-stance
2400 shot tfraglod_emu_village2
2700 exit
